.TH "bead schema explain" 1  "bead schema explain " 
.SH NAME
bead schema explain \- Explain a public schema
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead schema explain\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCHEMA_REF\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Explain an exact public schema identity as deterministic typed JSON or Markdown.
.PP
The explanation describes ownership, transport, supported operations, and the schema\*(Aqs public members.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR=\fIFORMAT\fR [default: json]
Output format
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRjson, markdown]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISCHEMA_REF\fR>
Exact schema identity
